{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02437",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 1.03,
      "end_seconds": 6.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "Doctor, we're ready in room two, I've already taken the observations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.29,
      "end_seconds": 13.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "Great. Hello, come in and sit down. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.42,
      "end_seconds": 28.27,
      "duration_seconds": 8.85,
      "text": "Mainly sudden severe pain in the left testicle. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.62,
      "end_seconds": 33.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.06,
      "end_seconds": 36.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Yeah, it's been two days now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.83,
      "end_seconds": 40.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.11,
      "end_seconds": 50.93,
      "duration_seconds": 8.82,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get a swollen scrotum as well. The swollen scrotum? That's been since yesterday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.35,
      "end_seconds": 53.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Any discharge or injury?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.13,
      "end_seconds": 58.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "No, no discharge or injury."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.34,
      "end_seconds": 62.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Any fever or burning when passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.41,
      "end_seconds": 68.43,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "No fever or burning when passing urine, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.7,
      "end_seconds": 74.77,
      "duration_seconds": 5.07,
      "text": "Have you noticed any weakness, or anything odd with your balance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.47,
      "end_seconds": 78.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "No weakness or anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.57,
      "end_seconds": 82.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "How are your bowels, any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.04,
      "end_seconds": 85.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.27,
      "end_seconds": 88.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.93,
      "end_seconds": 94.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.66,
      "end_seconds": 99.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.35,
      "end_seconds": 106.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.53,
      "end_seconds": 112.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Alright, how active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.73,
      "end_seconds": 118.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.1,
      "end_seconds": 134.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.33,
      "end_seconds": 138.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Acid reflux, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.53,
      "end_seconds": 154.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.89,
      "end_seconds": 158.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "It's pantoprazole, before breakfast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.14,
      "end_seconds": 162.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Right, and what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.61,
      "end_seconds": 173.31,
      "duration_seconds": 9.7,
      "text": "40 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box. Right, I was on omeprazole before. I stopped taking it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.17,
      "end_seconds": 177.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.73,
      "end_seconds": 182.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 183.38,
      "end_seconds": 199.83,
      "duration_seconds": 16.45,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. BMI works out to 21.6, respiratory rate 14, pulse is 84 beats a minute, SpO2 98 percent on room air, temperature is 36.5 degrees, weight 56 kilos, pressure 113 over 77, height 161 centimetres."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.18,
      "end_seconds": 202.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.61,
      "end_seconds": 209.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.42,
      "end_seconds": 211.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.02,
      "end_seconds": 235.26,
      "duration_seconds": 7.24,
      "text": "The left testicle is high, swollen and extremely tender, and the reflex on that side is missing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.79,
      "end_seconds": 239.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Please sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.79,
      "end_seconds": 259.79,
      "duration_seconds": 10.0,
      "text": "Putting it all together, I think we're dealing with testicular torsion needing emergency surgery at this stage. An epididymitis is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.39,
      "end_seconds": 263.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.57,
      "end_seconds": 283.5,
      "duration_seconds": 18.93,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's testicular torsion needing emergency surgery, and we'll watch how it goes. So, to recap quickly. You've had sudden severe pain in the left testicle for two days, and no burning when passing urine or discharge."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.24,
      "end_seconds": 292.63,
      "duration_seconds": 7.39,
      "text": "Yes, that's right. Well, could I get an urgent scrotal ultrasound done? A friend had it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.15,
      "end_seconds": 307.07,
      "duration_seconds": 9.92,
      "text": "Not at this point, no. It isn't indicated yet. Today I'm not changing anything. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.2,
      "end_seconds": 313.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    }
  ]
}